# FAKE credentials for the pipeline's scanner fixture. They are not real, they
# belong to no account, and the repo allowlists this exact path. Scanners that
# detect by pattern must still report them when the allowlist is not applied.
# Gitleaks skips low-entropy strings and TruffleHog skips strings that spell
# out "not a real token", so each tool gets the shape it still reports.
GITLEAKS_PLANT=ghp_NOTAREALTOKENNOTAREALTOKENNOTAREALTOKE
TRUFFLEHOG_PLANT=ghp_FAKEFAKEFAKEFAKEFAKEFAKEFAKEFAKEFAKE
